:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Kiss and Koi (Enemy)]].''
'''Koi Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Love is Sickness (Monthly Event)|Love is Sickness]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.5 Update|Version 2.2.5]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] greatly increases speed and gains Area Attack. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], it was made obtainable in the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1.

